<td id="S1.T1.5.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;"><span id="S1.T1.5.7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Complex-TR <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib13" title="" class="ltx_ref">Tan et al.,2024</a></cite></span></td>
